00:52:11,140 --> 00:52:15,140
So multi-core is an example of conceptually,

540
00:52:15,140 --> 00:52:21,140
multi-threaded computation, remember, you're working within a single virtual address space

541
00:52:21,140 --> 00:52:27,260
and you have private stacks, but the more global, the heat memory,

542
00:52:27,260 --> 00:52:30,260
is completely shared across threads.

