00:55:27,670 --> 00:55:34,920
In other words, to have them both print the original values of these two variables.

581
00:55:34,920 --> 00:55:44,530
And that's impossible because I have to have done at least one right before I can reach either of these two print statements.

582
00:55:44,530 --> 00:55:46,290
print statements, right?

583
00:55:46,290 --> 00:55:55,350
So it's not possible for these to still be in their original values when I hit these print statements.

